;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------;
;	TRUE FANS WITH COPIES OF THE SOURCE CODE ONLY:													;
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------;
;	Bo Schmoe's real name was once Bo Brinkman. However due to his unbelievable god given talent,	;
;	Bo asked his parents to allow him to change his name to Schmoe to escape the publicity that is	;
;	the celebrity programmer lifestyle. Since changing his name Bo has been able to live in,		;
;	obscurity. However, falling into the Grand Canyon threatens his way of life by attracting news	;
;	media from all over the nation. Bo fears that this renewed publicity will prompt the media to 	;
;	find out who Bo Schmoe really is, a skeleton he had long ago buried deep in his closet. 		;
;																									;
;	Help Bo and his step-brother Joe dig themselves out of the canyon by throwing rocks down to		;
;	little Bo.																						;
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------;
